             fp.write("description=Global model resolution\n")
             fp.write("           =See HELP PANEL, especially\n")
             fp.write("           =if wanting to run at N1280.\n")
             fp.write("help=Choose from one of the following standard Global model resolutions:\n")
             fp.write("    =\n")
             fp.write("    =Note that the resolution stated below in km is the North-South resolution,\n")
             fp.write("    =which is valid anywhere in the world. The convergence of the meridians means \n")
             fp.write("    =that the East-West resolution varies with latitude. It is approximately the \n")
             fp.write("    =the same as the North-south resolution in mid-latitudes. The grid-length  \n")
             fp.write("    =increases as one moves towards the equator, and is 1.5 times coarser than the \n")
             fp.write("    =North-South resolution on the Equator. Conversely, polewards of 48 degrees the \n")
             fp.write("    =East-West resolution is finer than the North-South resolution.\n")
             fp.write("    =\n")
             fp.write("    =1. n96  - 192 x 144 grid points (125 km) \n")
             fp.write("    =2. n216 - 432 x 324 grid points (60 km) \n")
             fp.write("    =3. n320 - 640 x 480 grid points (40 km) \n")
             fp.write("    =4. n512 - 1024 x 768 grid points (25 km) \n")
             fp.write("    =5. n768 - 1536 x 1152 grid points (17 km) \n")
             fp.write("    =6. n1280- 2560 x 1920 grid points (10 km) \n")
             fp.write("    =\n")
             fp.write("    =As at July 2017, at the Met Office there isn't\n")
             fp.write("    =an N1280 GA6.0 ancillary directory. This means that the \n")
             fp.write("    =ancil_versions_ga6 soft link created on the HPC in directory \n")
             fp.write("    =share/data/etc needs the directory GA6.0 manually changing to ps39.\n")
             fp.write("    =\n")
             fp.write("    =INFO for non-Met Office sites:- the N1280 global model\n")
             fp.write("    =initially failed on the Met Office HPCs in jules_allocate.\n")
             fp.write("    =To get around this problem the hugepages module was NOT \n")
             fp.write("    =loaded up when running the global model. See e.g. changes in \n")
             fp.write("    =site/mo1b-cray-xc40/suite-adds.rc (search on N1280).\n")
             fp.write("    =\n")
             fp.write('values="n96","n216","n320","n512","n640","n768","n1280"\n')
             fp.write("\n")

